---
// Screenshots & Media Showcase for Biprompter
---

<section id="gallery" class="py-16 sm:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 text-xs font-mono mb-4">
      <span>🖼️ Ekran Görüntüleri & Önizleme</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">
      Zarif tasarım, profesyonel stüdyo deneyimi.
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-400">
      Metinlerinizi rahatça düzenleyebileceğiniz stüdyo panelinden ekranın tepesinde süzülen minimal ada moduna kadar her ayrıntı özenle düşünüldü.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Featured Animated Demo GIF -->
  <div class="mb-12 biprompter-glass-panel rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-6 border border-zinc-800 overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-4 mb-4 border-b border-zinc-800/80 text-xs text-zinc-400">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-sky-400 animate-pulse"></span>
        <span class="font-medium text-zinc-200">Canlı Akış & Mod Geçişleri</span>
      </div>
      <span class="font-mono text-zinc-500 text-[11px]">Gerçek Ekran Kaydı (.gif)</span>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-black/60 border border-zinc-800/60">
      <img
        src="/biprompter/biprompter_demo.gif"
        alt="Biprompter Canlı Demo Akışı"
        loading="lazy"
        class="w-full h-auto object-cover rounded-xl"
      />
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 3 Side-by-Side Screenshots -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
    <!-- Screen 1: Studio Editor -->
    <div class="biprompter-glass-panel rounded-2xl p-4 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-black/50 border border-zinc-800/80 mb-4">
        <img
          src="/biprompter/editor_preview.png"
          alt="Studio Editör & Konuşma Kütüphanesi"
          loading="lazy"
          class="w-full h-auto object-cover hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"
        />
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-white">1. Stüdyo Editör Paneli</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-zinc-400">
          Konuşma metinlerinizi hazırlayın, dil modellerini tek tıkla seçin ve konuşma hızını kalibre edin.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Screen 2: Dynamic Island -->
    <div class="biprompter-glass-panel rounded-2xl p-4 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-black/50 border border-zinc-800/80 mb-4">
        <img
          src="/biprompter/island_prompter.png"
          alt="Mac Dynamic Island Prompter Kapsülü"
          loading="lazy"
          class="w-full h-auto object-cover hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"
        />
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-white">2. Dynamic Island Kapsülü</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-zinc-400">
          Ekranın üstünde yüzen, sesinizi anlık dinleyen, reji direktiflerini renklendiren akıllı hap ada.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Screen 3: Notch Mode -->
    <div class="biprompter-glass-panel rounded-2xl p-4 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-black border border-zinc-800/80 mb-4 p-4 flex items-center justify-center min-h-[140px]">
        <img
          src="/biprompter/notch_mode.png"
          alt="Zıplayan Ok Çentik Modu"
          loading="lazy"
          class="h-10 w-auto object-contain hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300"
        />
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-white">3. Minimalist Çentik (Ok) Modu</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-zinc-400">
          Tek bir tuşla (<kbd class="biprompter-kbd text-[10px]">Alt + D</kbd>) ekranın en tepesine sığınarak sadece küçük bir zıplayan oka dönüşür.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
